        <mxCell id="20" value="&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-top:4px;text-align:center;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Saved Payment Method&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot;/&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;+ customer-assigned label&lt;br/&gt;+ last four digits&lt;br/&gt;+ card brand&lt;br/&gt;+ wallet provider&lt;br/&gt;+ expiry month&lt;br/&gt;+ expiry year&lt;br/&gt;+ date added&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot;/&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;+ owning customer account : Customer Account&lt;br/&gt;+ vendor-token reference : Payment Vendor, StripeWave, PayNova, VaultPay&lt;br/&gt;+ processing vendor : Payment Vendor&lt;br/&gt;+ default payment method flag : Default Payment Method&lt;br/&gt;+ selectable at checkout : Payment Method Selector, Order, Payment&lt;br/&gt;+ save during checkout on opt-in : Customer Account, StripeWave, PayNova, VaultPay&lt;br/&gt;+ add and soft-delete : Customer Account&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1">
